Conventions checklist page template
title end

paragraph start
A checklist page lists steps to tick, one task per paragraph. It uses the todo file type. A todo line marks a task open, and starting the description with done marks it finished.
paragraph end

paragraph start
One checklist per page and one purpose per checklist, so it can be run without reading anything else.
paragraph end

